cted  bronchitis, , and rheumatic joint diseases. I have also handled numerous acute cases and served for 5 years in the intensive care units of Damascus hospitals. I have been certified by the Syrian Board of Internal Medicine as a specialist physician since 2011. I am fluent in Arabic and English, and have an intermediate level of German.<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0fdbd5b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"0fdbd5b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Years of Experience:<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5f01666 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"5f01666\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">15 years of clinical experience.<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-302575c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"302575c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Language<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5e7a1b2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"5e7a1b2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Arabic<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6536f12 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"6536f12\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">English<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<